            "title": "黑期低水逾140點 ADR指數低收",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">新加坡黑期於今早約8時22分跌142點或0.63%，報22,269點。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"AP圖片\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/04/20230808_FI_source-ap_港股1.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"AP圖片\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/04/20230808_FI_source-ap_港股1.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">AP圖片</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">港股ADR指數報22,279點，較香港上日現貨收市低132點或0.6%。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">恒指期貨夜市收報22,238點，跌192點，較上日恒指收市22,410點，低水173點。科指期貨夜市收報3,456點，較上日科指收市低水55點；國指期貨夜市收報7,512點，較上日國指收市低水42點。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/17241696-%e9%bb%91%e6%9c%9f%e4%bd%8e%e6%b0%b4%e9%80%be140%e9%bb%9e-adr%e6%8c%87%e6%95%b8%e4%bd%8e%e6%94%b6",
